&lt;li&gt;Understanding of public sector requirements for data privacy, accessibility, and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in a changing environment or building an emerging sales motion, with certification or formal training in deal qualification and prospect discovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
