&lt;li&gt;Partner across the People function and our cross functional partners to help execute the People strategy across the PDE organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and insights to inform your point of view, measure impact, and tell a compelling story to the leaders you support&lt;/li&gt;
