&lt;li&gt;Experience in a similar role at a creative, design, collaboration, or productivity-focused SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in VFX, post-production, Creative, UX/UI, Design Ops, or Frontend Development&lt;/li&gt;
