&lt;li&gt;5+ years managing PMs, experience coaching a senior bench of PMs, and fostering collaborative, high-performance, joyful team environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking and UX judgment, with a demonstrated ability to set pace and operate with high agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it&#39;s not required, it&#39;s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
