&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figma is looking for a Manager, SMB Sales to join a team that spans creative, engineering, marketing, and business functions. You aren&#39;t the typical sales leader, and we aren&#39;t the typical design software company. With this role, you&#39;ll join a sales org at an early, high-growth stage, with real opportunity to shape process and strategy from the ground up. You&#39;ll consult with our existing customer base and potential customers in driving meaningful relationships that add value to the customer experience and revenue to our bottom line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Sales org is growing and moving fast. Our next team member will be comfortable embracing change, work well as part of a team, and enjoy working with our growing footprint of Fortune 1000 customers. You won&#39;t be alone! Figma has an incredible team and you&#39;ll work closely with other groups including Support, Design, Engineering, Product Marketing, and Community. As our Manager, SMB Sales, you will develop a team of Account Executives responsible for continuing the growth of our product suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role that can be held from one of our US hubs or remotely in the United States.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
