&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, building, and growing successful, collaborative, and hard-working sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent history of leading over-performing sales teams, with a track record of developing strong customer relationships and an emphasis on satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
