&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a customer-facing role within B2B SaaS, working with technical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong organizational and project management skills, with a proven ability to manage multiple customer projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with customers across various roles and levels of seniority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex business and technical environments effectively, applying a consultative approach to understand and address customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
