&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Paint the vision of Payload within the Figma Platform and guide customers in realizing the value through product demonstrations and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
