&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the customer IT and Security relationship during the deal cycle by addressing security questionnaires and enterprise&amp;nbsp; requirements, in order to help customers adopt the platform securely and at scale&lt;/li&gt;
